WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.260
A small lamp glows in a dark room, sending
out its light equally in all directions.

2
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:11.700
It gives out 3 watts of light, and none
is absorbed or reflected on the way.

3
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:17.060
You stand close to it, then slowly walk
back until you are twice as far away.

4
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.910
How quickly does the
light reaching you fade?

5
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.100
Does it halve?

6
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.080
Or does something else happen?

7
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:25.620
In this mission, you'll define intensity:

8
00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:30.270
the power arriving on each
unit of area, facing the wave.

9
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.010
Then you'll follow the light
as it spreads outwards,

10
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.670
and work out how much of it reaches you.

11
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:40.200
Your mission: find out how quickly
the light fades as you walk away.
